Package: getBio
Type: Package
Title: Helper Functions for Bulk and Single-Cell RNA-seq Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of convenience functions for expression matrix
    preprocessing, limma differential expression, GO/KEGG/GSEA/GSVA
    enrichment, common plots (heatmap, PCA, volcano, violin, Venn, scatter)
    and Seurat-based single-cell workflows.
